nt un lien les reliant à travers l'infini.","Sans interférence de la civilisation, la nature s'adapte toujours à ses propres besoins.","文明の手による介入がなければ、自然は必ずその必要に応じて自らを変容させる。","Die Kunst, das Licht eines fernen Sterns in einem Ring aus reinem Gold einzufangen, ist mit der Zeit","O senhor inquestionável das montanhas de Shiv.","Todas las semillas comparten un lazo, llamándose entre ellas a través del infinito.","全ての種には繋がりがあり、互いを無限の彼方から呼び合う。","L'art de l'artificier de piéger la lumière d'un astre lointain dans un anneau d'or le plus pur est d","Persa col tempo è l'arte dell'artefice di intrappolare la luce di una stella lontana in un anello di","Tutti i semi condividono un legame comune, chiamandosi l'un l'altro nello spazio infinito.","Alle Samen haben eine Verbindung zueinander, die durch die Unendlichkeit hindurch reicht.","Eine brennende Sonne, die nie untergeht.","Fai due passi a nord nel futuro incerto, a sud nel passato inquieto, a est nel giorno attuale o a ov","在葛瑞克的一生中，这是他首次感到内心的温情与暖意。"]],"language":["TEXT",0.0,"10^1",["AAAAAAA","AAAAAA","AAAAAAAA"],["Japanese","French","German","Italian","Spanish","Portuguese (Brazil)","Chinese Simplified","Russian","Chinese Traditional","Korean"]],"multiverseid":["INTEGER",1.0,0,[null,null,null],[]],"name":["TEXT",0.97,"10^2",["AAAA","AA","AAAAAAAA"],null],"text":["TEXT",0.806,"10^2",["","AA","AAAAA._(AAAA_AAAAAAAA_AA_AAAAA_AAA_AAAAAAAAA_AAAAAAA_AAA_AAAAAAAAA_AAA_AAAAAA_AA…"],null],"type":["TEXT",0.006,"10^3",["","AA","AAAAAAA"],null],"uuid":["TEXT",0.763,"10^3",["999A99A9-9A99-999A-9A99-AA99AAA999AA","99999999-999A-99AA-9999-999A9A99A999","99AAA999-9A99-9A99-A999-9999A9AAA9A9"],null]},"legalities":{"id":["INTEGER",0.0,"10^5",[100000.0,200000.0,200000.0],null],"format":["TEXT",0.0,"10^1",["AAAAAA","AAAAAAAAA","AAAAAAA"],["commander","vintage","legacy","duel","modern","penny","pauper","pioneer","premodern","gladiator","historic","future","standard","brawl","oldschool"]],"status":["TEXT",0.0,"10^0",["AAAAA","AAAAAA","AAAAAAAA